678 723 675Q723 673 717 649Q189 54 188 52L185 49H274Q369 50 377 51Q452 60 500 100T579 247Q587 272 590 277T603 282H607Q628 282 628 271Q547 5 541 2Q538 0 300 0H124Q58 0 58 8Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E7-MJMATHI-5A\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span> lies within. This interval is indicated in the diagram below:</p>\n<div id=\"graphic-ecd56581880a6de7bcb44b1b91bca82b\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/ecd56581880a6de7bcb44b1b91bca82b\"></div>  \n\n<p>To help with the notation, we define a new parameter <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"2.134ex\" height=\"1.676ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.338ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -576.1 919 721.6\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-8-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-8-Title\">\\alpha.</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E8-MJMATHI-3B1\" d=\"M34 156Q34 270 120 356T309 442Q379 442 421 402T478 304Q484 275 485 237V208Q534 282 560 374Q564 388 566 390T582 393Q603 393 603 385Q603 376 594 346T558 261T497 161L486 147L487 123Q489 67 495 47T514 26Q528 28 540 37T557 60Q559 67 562 68T577 70Q597 70 597 62Q597 56 591 43Q579 19 556 5T512 -10H505Q438 -10 414 62L411 69L400 61Q390 53 370 41T325 18T267 -2T203 -11Q124 -11 79 39T34 156ZM208 26Q257 26 306 47T379 90L403 112Q401 255 396 290Q382 405 304 405Q235 405 183 332Q156 292 139 224T121 120Q121 71 146 49T208 26Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E8-MJMAIN-2E\" d=\"M78 60Q78 84 95 102T138 120Q162 120 180 104T199 61Q199 36 182 18T139 0T96 17T78 60Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E8-MJMATHI-3B1\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E8-MJMAIN-2E\" x=\"640\" y=\"0\"></